 "id": 567937,
 "name": "Upload Workday employees report to Box",
 "description": "At 12:00am UTC daily, extract information from the Workday report and sync it to a Box folder as a CSV file\n\n- Input the URL into action step 1\n- If the URL is entered correctly, you will be able to see the data output on the right hand side when you map the fields in step 2 for the creation of the CSV\n- You will need to add in your own column labels depending on what shows up in the report\n- It is currently uploaded to a folder named Reports in Box, do change it in step 3 if you want to upload it to another folder",
